# The POC's three-tenant baseline (UNI-305). Every scored run in
# docs/poc-results.md used exactly this set; it is the default for every
# harness script that reads a tenant manifest, and deploy/poc/00-config.yaml's
# `groups:` list must agree with it (`python3 -I deploy/poc/tenants.py check`).
#
# Format: one tenant per line, whitespace-separated columns, '#' comments.
# See deploy/poc/tenants.py for the full column reference.
#
# group      weight  match                  keys                          workers  rate  shape
app1         20      exact:app1-production  app1-production               -        -     fixed
app2         10      exact:app2-batch       app2-batch                    -        -     unique
end-users    65      prefix:end-user-       end-user-alpha,end-user-beta  -        -     long
